      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hey there, sorry for the trouble. Looks like one of your favorite group documents in our database got some bad data assigned to it and was getting merged with another favorite list.\n\nI've adjusted the database record to match with how it's expected, please let me know if this is fixed or you're encountering any more problems. You may have to add a favorite to the affected VRC+ favorite list named \"室内・狭い\" in order to invalidate the bad cached data if needed!\n\nCertainly a weird one! Thanks for the tip, I'll have to check if anyone else is affected.",
