      "value": "@{5ac57845180a7e323c02d48d|full_name}\n\nHello,\n\nI checked both the website and VRChat to see whether the issue had been fixed.\n\nI was able to add and move favorite worlds properly on both, and I confirmed that the problem has been completely resolved.\n\nThank you very much!",
